1
00:01:30,440 --> 00:01:34,970
[AWAKEN]

2
00:01:35,620 --> 00:01:37,870
[Episode 5]

3
00:01:55,870 --> 00:01:58,590
Cheers to
the Greater East Asia Co-Prosperity!

4
00:01:58,759 --> 00:02:00,400
-Cheers!
-Cheers!

5
00:02:09,160 --> 00:02:10,630
I am Hoshino Eisei.

6
00:02:10,650 --> 00:02:11,650
Nice to meet you.

7
00:02:38,710 --> 00:02:39,680
Chen Kailai,

8
00:02:39,870 --> 00:02:41,070
you've risen to fame!

9
00:02:49,280 --> 00:02:50,280
See for yourself.

10
00:02:53,990 --> 00:02:55,590
[Weekly Supplement, Issue No. 238]

11
00:02:56,060 --> 00:02:58,060
You managed to find such tiny print.

12
00:02:58,710 --> 00:03:00,030
How very annoying.

13
00:03:01,150 --> 00:03:02,480
I don't like this photo.

14
00:03:03,470 --> 00:03:05,000
But I like the money.

15
00:03:05,800 --> 00:03:07,120
It upsets you, though.

16
00:03:09,750 --> 00:03:11,630
When people see this picture,

17
00:03:12,280 --> 00:03:14,140
will they think of me as a traitor?

18
00:03:14,310 --> 00:03:15,560
As long as you're not one,

19
00:03:15,560 --> 00:03:17,420
why care about what others think?

20
00:03:18,910 --> 00:03:19,710
Well...

21
00:03:21,000 --> 00:03:22,030
Did they pay you?

22
00:03:23,430 --> 00:03:24,310
No, not yet.

23
00:03:25,000 --> 00:03:26,530
You should've asked for it.

24
00:03:26,800 --> 00:03:27,840
With so many people there,

25
00:03:27,840 --> 00:03:29,100
how could I have asked?

26
00:03:29,240 --> 00:03:30,170
Maybe next time.

27
00:03:32,110 --> 00:03:32,680
Fine.

28
00:03:33,460 --> 00:03:34,560
You took the photos already.

29
00:03:34,560 --> 00:03:36,000
Try not to be harsh on yourself.

30
00:03:36,000 --> 00:03:37,600
Don't forget to get your pay.

31
00:03:39,280 --> 00:03:40,750
If Li Musheng knew

32
00:03:41,240 --> 00:03:43,170
that I promoted this kind of event,

33
00:03:43,190 --> 00:03:45,450
he'd be very disappointed, wouldn't he?

34
00:03:45,520 --> 00:03:46,680
Didn't Li Musheng often

35
00:03:46,680 --> 00:03:48,340
take photos for traitors too?

36
00:03:48,710 --> 00:03:50,120
But at critical times,

37
00:03:50,250 --> 00:03:51,980
he chose to die for his beliefs.

38
00:03:55,150 --> 00:03:56,880
If Li Musheng were still alive,

39
00:03:57,120 --> 00:03:59,700
he would've been supportive
of you taking this job.

40
00:03:59,700 --> 00:04:01,120
Only when you are strong enough

41
00:04:01,120 --> 00:04:02,610
will you be able to do more.

42
00:04:04,960 --> 00:04:06,290
When you put it that way,

43
00:04:06,870 --> 00:04:09,560
taking photos for those people
is not necessarily a bad thing.

44
00:04:09,560 --> 00:04:10,360
Of course.

45
00:04:10,670 --> 00:04:12,130
Money is never a bad thing.

46
00:04:16,450 --> 00:04:18,010
Perhaps this job

47
00:04:18,660 --> 00:04:20,260
will be of help in the future.

48
00:04:21,310 --> 00:04:23,170
What are you muttering about now?

49
00:04:24,270 --> 00:04:25,040
I said,

50
00:04:25,500 --> 00:04:27,060
I must get my pay back.

51
00:04:36,240 --> 00:04:37,800
Newspapers! Newspapers for sale!

52
00:04:37,800 --> 00:04:39,510
Co-prosperity! Co-prosperity!

53
00:04:39,510 --> 00:04:41,190
Newspapers for sale!

54
00:04:41,190 --> 00:04:43,000
Co-prosperity! Co-prosperity!

55
00:04:43,000 --> 00:04:44,720
Newspapers! Co-prosperity!

56
00:04:44,720 --> 00:04:46,190
Read the newspaper!

57
00:04:46,430 --> 00:04:48,720
Newspapers for sale!

58
00:04:48,720 --> 00:04:50,480
Co-prosperity is on the way!

59
00:04:50,870 --> 00:04:52,240
Newspapers for sale!

60
00:04:52,240 --> 00:04:53,360
Co-prosperity!

61
00:04:53,360 --> 00:04:54,560
Newspapers for sale!

62
00:04:57,510 --> 00:04:58,830
The plague outbreaks in multiple places

63
00:04:58,830 --> 00:05:01,070
are related to the Japanese's intention
of expanding the scope

64
00:05:01,070 --> 00:05:03,040
of biological warfare
with Project Slumber.

65
00:05:03,040 --> 00:05:03,800
I guess

66
00:05:03,950 --> 00:05:06,080
they're trying to end the war quickly.

67
00:05:07,040 --> 00:05:07,720
Right now,

68
00:05:07,720 --> 00:05:08,630
we still haven't

69
00:05:08,630 --> 00:05:10,760
found a way to decode Project Slumber.

70
00:05:11,240 --> 00:05:13,840
We might gain an opportunity
through Hoshino.

71
00:05:23,330 --> 00:05:25,680
[Delegation of the Japan Far East
Corporation arrives in Shanghai]

72
00:05:25,680 --> 00:05:28,040
[to promote
the Greater Asia Co-Prosperity]

73
00:05:29,510 --> 00:05:30,640
Shanghai Race Club.

74
00:05:58,659 --> 00:06:04,330
♪ Clear waters stir in the cool breeze ♪

75
00:06:46,650 --> 00:06:50,260
[Spring Meeting of Shanghai Race Club:
China-Japan Friendship Match]

76
00:06:58,270 --> 00:07:00,240
Send one more team of guards
to the entrance.

77
00:07:00,240 --> 00:07:02,470
Make sure no sharp weapons are brought in.

78
00:07:02,470 --> 00:07:03,080
Got it.

79
00:07:08,600 --> 00:07:10,800
Captain Cang, which horse is your pick?

80
00:07:12,170 --> 00:07:14,800
The odds are so low
that they make me drowsy.

81
00:07:14,870 --> 00:07:16,800
You're betting on a race like this?

82
00:07:17,270 --> 00:07:18,230
Just for fun.

83
00:07:22,690 --> 00:07:25,360
[China-Japan Friendship Match]

84
00:07:23,240 --> 00:07:25,970
What a so-called
China-Japan friendship match.

85
00:07:26,480 --> 00:07:29,590
How many of the audience are actually here
to watch the race?

86
00:07:29,590 --> 00:07:32,320
Most of them are Japanese
who plan to put on a show.

87
00:07:33,800 --> 00:07:35,000
And that woman, look.

88
00:07:35,750 --> 00:07:38,630
She's even going to ride around the track
as the Chinese representative.

89
00:07:38,630 --> 00:07:40,070
She takes all the spotlight,

90
00:07:40,070 --> 00:07:42,070
while we have to do all the hard work.

91
00:07:43,800 --> 00:07:45,190
What a massive crowd.

92
00:07:46,120 --> 00:07:48,780
You're in for a challenging task,
Captain Cang.

93
00:08:57,480 --> 00:08:58,170
No entry.

94
00:09:19,900 --> 00:09:21,140
Cigarettes for sale!

95
00:09:21,170 --> 00:09:22,190
Cigarettes for sale!

96
00:09:22,190 --> 00:09:24,390
Cigarettes, sunflower seeds,
and osmanthus candy for sale!

97
00:09:24,390 --> 00:09:25,510
-How's your business today?
-Sir.

98
00:09:25,510 --> 00:09:26,200
Not bad, I'd say.

99
00:09:26,200 --> 00:09:27,130
I'll take a pack.

100
00:09:45,000 --> 00:09:46,200
Everyone, get ready!

101
00:09:46,840 --> 00:09:47,550
Load up!

102
00:09:50,320 --> 00:09:51,450
Aim at the bullseye!

103
00:09:53,910 --> 00:09:54,510
Fire!

104
00:09:56,080 --> 00:09:57,210
Aim at the bullseye!

105
00:09:57,480 --> 00:09:58,200
Fire!

106
00:09:59,320 --> 00:09:59,960
Fire!

107
00:10:01,150 --> 00:10:01,870
Fire!

108
00:10:03,240 --> 00:10:03,870
Fire!

109
00:10:05,500 --> 00:10:06,790
This is my horse,

110
00:10:07,200 --> 00:10:08,790
named Shenjun.

111
00:10:09,120 --> 00:10:09,870
Shenjun?

112
00:10:09,890 --> 00:10:10,590
How beautiful.

113
00:10:10,590 --> 00:10:11,450
Cute, isn't it?

114
00:10:12,910 --> 00:10:13,840
So handsome.

115
00:10:13,840 --> 00:10:14,790
Handsome, yes.

116
00:10:18,640 --> 00:10:19,840
Here's a gift for you.

117
00:10:26,200 --> 00:10:27,200
I named this photo

118
00:10:27,510 --> 00:10:28,480
"A Man."

119
00:10:32,910 --> 00:10:33,550
Thank you.

120
00:10:35,030 --> 00:10:36,290
You gave it a nice name.

121
00:10:38,910 --> 00:10:39,870
"A Man."

122
00:10:41,240 --> 00:10:43,720
I hope the war ends soon.

123
00:10:46,390 --> 00:10:47,630
You also hate war?

124
00:10:51,910 --> 00:10:53,000
Who would love it?

125
00:10:55,390 --> 00:10:56,650
My name is Chen Kailai.

126
00:10:56,840 --> 00:10:58,440
I'm a Chinese photographer.

127
00:10:59,750 --> 00:11:01,480
My name is Shota Ishida.

128
00:11:01,910 --> 00:11:03,570
I'm Dr. Hoshino's assistant.

129
00:11:05,890 --> 00:11:06,800
Pleased to meet you.

130
00:11:06,800 --> 00:11:08,130
Pleased to meet you too.

131
00:12:31,710 --> 00:12:32,360
Watch out!

132
00:12:38,360 --> 00:12:39,080
Su Men!

133
00:12:40,250 --> 00:12:41,450
Why just stand there?

134
00:12:41,570 --> 00:12:42,770
Protect Mr. Hoshino!

135
00:12:46,170 --> 00:12:46,830
Quick, run!

136
00:12:55,660 --> 00:12:56,940
Surround them, now!

137
00:13:00,280 --> 00:13:03,210
The sniper's on the rooftop
across the track. Hurry!

138
00:13:09,120 --> 00:13:09,840
Across the track!

139
00:13:09,840 --> 00:13:10,570
Get a move on!

140
00:13:17,740 --> 00:13:19,470
Escort Mr. Hoshino out of here.

141
00:13:19,750 --> 00:13:20,470
Careful.

142
00:13:32,960 --> 00:13:33,720
Move faster!

143
00:13:33,720 --> 00:13:34,150
Hurry!

144
00:13:34,150 --> 00:13:35,080
Come with me!

145
00:13:35,720 --> 00:13:36,650
Watch your back!

146
00:13:43,080 --> 00:13:43,960
Ms. Su Men...

147
00:13:48,840 --> 00:13:49,550
Go away!

148
00:14:00,360 --> 00:14:01,830
I'm fine. Quick, run!

149
00:14:01,960 --> 00:14:02,630
Move!

150
00:14:03,360 --> 00:14:04,150
Move now!

151
00:14:04,600 --> 00:14:05,600
Let's go!

152
00:14:06,480 --> 00:14:07,790
Hurry, guys! Keep up!

153
00:14:08,840 --> 00:14:09,390
Go!

154
00:14:09,510 --> 00:14:10,360
Quick!

155
00:14:10,870 --> 00:14:11,790
Chen Kailai?

156
00:14:13,800 --> 00:14:15,830
It's never easy to earn your money.

157
00:14:27,910 --> 00:14:28,790
That's the guy!

158
00:14:28,960 --> 00:14:29,510
Go after him!

159
00:14:29,510 --> 00:14:30,640
Hurry! Go after him!

160
00:14:40,080 --> 00:14:40,750
Quick!

161
00:14:53,000 --> 00:14:53,670
Run faster!

162
00:15:05,450 --> 00:15:06,450
I failed.

163
00:15:17,510 --> 00:15:18,790
Help these people! Quick!

164
00:15:18,790 --> 00:15:19,550
Go inside!

165
00:15:19,550 --> 00:15:20,360
Doctor, quick!

166
00:15:20,360 --> 00:15:21,360
-Go inside!
-Get in there!

167
00:15:21,360 --> 00:15:22,150
-Keep going in.
-This way!

168
00:15:22,150 --> 00:15:23,150
Make way please!

169
00:15:23,670 --> 00:15:24,790
Don't crowd up here. Come on.

170
00:15:24,790 --> 00:15:25,630
This way.

171
00:15:27,320 --> 00:15:27,960
This way, please.

172
00:15:27,960 --> 00:15:28,690
Go! This way!

173
00:15:33,440 --> 00:15:36,120
A spring-loaded gun of this sort
is pretty compact.

174
00:15:36,120 --> 00:15:38,520
It was used only to create
a distraction...

175
00:15:40,730 --> 00:15:41,420
General,

176
00:15:42,440 --> 00:15:43,390
we have found out

177
00:15:43,720 --> 00:15:45,850
the mastermind behind this incident.

178
00:15:58,000 --> 00:16:00,040
The steel balls are coated with poison,

179
00:16:00,040 --> 00:16:02,970
which is exactly usually used
by the Hurricane Team.

180
00:16:10,440 --> 00:16:12,970
The antidote has been sent
to Renji Hospital.

181
00:16:13,400 --> 00:16:15,530
Inspector Su only suffered
superficial wounds.

182
00:16:15,530 --> 00:16:16,300
She is fine.

183
00:16:24,670 --> 00:16:25,550
Director Li,

184
00:16:26,850 --> 00:16:28,850
I've long admired your talent.

185
00:16:30,380 --> 00:16:33,290
I hope you won't disappoint me again!

186
00:16:41,270 --> 00:16:42,200
I know, General,

187
00:16:42,790 --> 00:16:44,790
that you are highly concerned about

188
00:16:45,360 --> 00:16:47,420
the insurgents lurking in Shanghai.

189
00:16:48,440 --> 00:16:49,700
Please give me a month.

190
00:16:50,150 --> 00:16:53,200
I promise to root out
the spy network of the NBIS.

191
00:16:58,000 --> 00:17:00,150
I hope you will succeed this time.

192
00:17:01,750 --> 00:17:02,510
If not,

193
00:17:03,270 --> 00:17:04,800
I will resign immediately.

194
00:17:06,030 --> 00:17:08,359
There should be punishment for failures.

195
00:17:10,510 --> 00:17:11,109
I got it.

196
00:17:12,510 --> 00:17:13,910
I will accept punishment

197
00:17:14,310 --> 00:17:15,030
if I fail.

198
00:17:37,350 --> 00:17:39,210
That's too intense, Director Li.

199
00:17:40,990 --> 00:17:42,590
You're a pillar of the state.

200
00:17:43,110 --> 00:17:45,640
But now, things are complicated
in Shanghai.

201
00:17:46,440 --> 00:17:49,170
That's why I assigned Su Men
to be your assistant.

202
00:17:52,750 --> 00:17:53,750
As it turns out,

203
00:17:54,400 --> 00:17:56,070
I made the right choice.

204
00:17:58,200 --> 00:18:01,110
Inspector Su's performance
in this incident truly shows

205
00:18:01,110 --> 00:18:02,680
what a heroine she is.

206
00:18:06,350 --> 00:18:07,790
You are a pillar of the state,

207
00:18:07,790 --> 00:18:09,050
while she is a heroine.

208
00:18:09,680 --> 00:18:12,010
You should hold each other in high regard.

209
00:18:12,650 --> 00:18:14,910
Whatever grudges between the two of you,

210
00:18:16,400 --> 00:18:17,930
Director Li, I hope you will

211
00:18:18,400 --> 00:18:20,400
always prioritize the big picture.

212
00:18:21,720 --> 00:18:22,350
General,

213
00:18:23,550 --> 00:18:24,550
you are mistaken.

214
00:18:25,640 --> 00:18:28,370
There are no grudges
between Inspector Su and me.

215
00:18:29,070 --> 00:18:30,270
Once she recovers,

216
00:18:30,550 --> 00:18:33,000
No. 76 welcomes her back anytime.

217
00:18:54,920 --> 00:18:56,320
How is Chen Kailai doing?

218
00:18:56,830 --> 00:18:59,030
The doctors said they'd try their best.

219
00:19:00,840 --> 00:19:02,300
Get him the finest doctor.

220
00:19:02,720 --> 00:19:03,880
I want him to live.

221
00:19:04,680 --> 00:19:05,310
Got it.

222
00:19:08,920 --> 00:19:10,750
Inspector Su, may I come in?

223
00:19:11,440 --> 00:19:12,110
Sure.

224
00:19:16,510 --> 00:19:18,640
Dr. Hoshino insisted on visiting you.

225
00:19:22,960 --> 00:19:24,290
Forgo the formalities.

226
00:19:25,440 --> 00:19:26,310
Dr. Hoshino,

227
00:19:27,030 --> 00:19:28,160
how's your injury?

228
00:19:29,240 --> 00:19:30,300
Not serious at all.

229
00:19:31,110 --> 00:19:33,840
I heard you were poisoned, Inspector Su.
Is it so?

230
00:19:38,310 --> 00:19:40,110
This is the best antidote for me.

231
00:19:44,400 --> 00:19:48,260
Every time I meet with you, Inspector Su,
there are always surprises.

232
00:19:50,510 --> 00:19:51,480
Dr. Hoshino,

233
00:19:52,110 --> 00:19:53,840
alcohol can be a pain reliever.

234
00:19:54,740 --> 00:19:55,540
Care for a try?

235
00:20:23,680 --> 00:20:26,960
Thank you for saving my life,
Inspector Su.

236
00:20:31,030 --> 00:20:32,090
Be seated, please.

237
00:20:32,360 --> 00:20:33,080
Sure.

238
00:21:12,400 --> 00:21:14,460
The transfusion is almost finished.

239
00:21:15,440 --> 00:21:16,490
The patient has lost too much blood.

240
00:21:16,490 --> 00:21:17,620
Get him another bag.

241
00:21:18,240 --> 00:21:19,350
We just received some wounded soldiers.

242
00:21:19,350 --> 00:21:21,080
The blood bank is out of plasma.

243
00:21:22,240 --> 00:21:22,970
I don't care.

244
00:21:23,000 --> 00:21:24,310
Figure it out yourselves. Hurry!

245
00:21:24,310 --> 00:21:24,920
But...

246
00:21:28,110 --> 00:21:29,310
I have type O blood.

247
00:21:30,000 --> 00:21:32,200
Available for testing and use anytime.

248
00:21:34,160 --> 00:21:35,200
Will he live?

249
00:21:37,030 --> 00:21:38,030
It's hard to tell.

250
00:21:38,070 --> 00:21:39,480
We've given him the antidote,

251
00:21:39,480 --> 00:21:41,140
but he has lost too much blood.

252
00:21:42,560 --> 00:21:43,960
Make use of the time then.

253
00:21:46,790 --> 00:21:48,790
It only counts if the patient lives.

254
00:22:07,480 --> 00:22:08,810
The patient has come to!

255
00:22:22,590 --> 00:22:24,750
I guess Chen Kailai is hiding
in the hospital,

256
00:22:24,750 --> 00:22:26,280
with a bad case of laziness.

257
00:22:30,160 --> 00:22:31,510
Where is Ward 1?

258
00:22:33,480 --> 00:22:34,140
Right here.

259
00:22:38,750 --> 00:22:39,880
You already woke up?

260
00:22:41,400 --> 00:22:43,130
Chen Kailai, you're awake now?

261
00:22:43,830 --> 00:22:44,960
Hand me the flowers.

262
00:22:45,070 --> 00:22:47,750
Remember, you must live a long life.

263
00:22:49,070 --> 00:22:50,310
My wound...

264
00:22:52,310 --> 00:22:53,310
Put them in a vase.

265
00:22:56,110 --> 00:22:58,110
You seem to be in great spirits.

266
00:22:58,640 --> 00:23:00,300
Does it really hurt that much?

267
00:23:07,210 --> 00:23:08,870
I brought your favorite food.

268
00:23:09,960 --> 00:23:11,310
Miss, please be quiet.

269
00:23:11,400 --> 00:23:12,960
The patient is not out of danger yet.

270
00:23:12,960 --> 00:23:14,110
He can't eat now.

271
00:23:15,720 --> 00:23:17,160
"Not out of danger yet"?

272
00:23:17,980 --> 00:23:19,440
You look pretty fine to me.

273
00:23:20,830 --> 00:23:22,430
Better listen to the doctor.

274
00:23:34,270 --> 00:23:35,550
Just take a bite in secret.

275
00:23:35,550 --> 00:23:36,880
The nurse won't notice.

276
00:23:42,400 --> 00:23:42,920
Come on.

277
00:23:44,070 --> 00:23:44,680
Eat up.

278
00:23:48,680 --> 00:23:49,350
Is it good?

279
00:23:53,310 --> 00:23:54,310
Are you hungry?

280
00:23:56,200 --> 00:23:57,600
You eat it then, alright?

281
00:23:57,920 --> 00:23:59,180
Why would he be hungry?

282
00:23:59,960 --> 00:24:01,310
He has done nothing all day,

283
00:24:01,310 --> 00:24:02,970
except for holding a bouquet.

284
00:24:03,110 --> 00:24:04,250
I'm really not hungry,

285
00:24:04,250 --> 00:24:06,050
because I can't feel it anymore.

286
00:24:07,350 --> 00:24:08,810
You're full of anger then.

287
00:24:14,310 --> 00:24:16,510
You got shot by a spring-loaded gun,
which is also known

288
00:24:16,510 --> 00:24:17,770
as a ball-bearing gun.

289
00:24:18,240 --> 00:24:19,680
It's a simple form of firearm,

290
00:24:19,680 --> 00:24:21,880
as it just consists of a tiny steel tube.

291
00:24:21,880 --> 00:24:23,000
But it could be lethal

292
00:24:23,000 --> 00:24:24,310
when fired from a short range.

293
00:24:24,310 --> 00:24:25,570
It's rather discreet.

294
00:24:26,400 --> 00:24:27,800
This time, you got lucky.

295
00:24:28,510 --> 00:24:29,970
How knowledgeable of you.

296
00:24:32,200 --> 00:24:33,440
I read all that from the magazine,

297
00:24:33,440 --> 00:24:35,900
The Detective, published by Youli Company.

298
00:24:36,480 --> 00:24:37,240
My absolute favorite

299
00:24:37,240 --> 00:24:39,300
is The Detective Stories of Huo Sang.

300
00:24:41,000 --> 00:24:42,130
Even a person like me

301
00:24:42,240 --> 00:24:44,000
loves literature.

302
00:24:45,070 --> 00:24:46,030
I want to sleep.

303
00:24:48,750 --> 00:24:49,440
Fine.

304
00:24:51,110 --> 00:24:53,310
We'll visit you again in a few days then.

305
00:24:54,030 --> 00:24:54,640
Oh, right.

306
00:24:55,400 --> 00:24:57,270
Du Huangqiao is such a weird guy.

307
00:24:57,720 --> 00:24:59,240
He told me to ask you if you are hungry.

308
00:24:59,240 --> 00:25:00,500
What should I tell him?

309
00:25:04,110 --> 00:25:04,840
Tell him yes.

310
00:25:07,400 --> 00:25:08,400
What does he mean?

311
00:25:08,960 --> 00:25:10,110
He must be wondering

312
00:25:10,110 --> 00:25:11,790
if Kailai is making a fast recovery.

313
00:25:11,790 --> 00:25:14,520
The hungrier you are,
the faster you'll recover.

314
00:25:16,270 --> 00:25:17,750
This blind man is cleverer

315
00:25:17,930 --> 00:25:18,920
than I thought.

316
00:25:21,440 --> 00:25:22,440
I'm leaving then.

317
00:25:24,200 --> 00:25:26,070
The flowers will stay here with you.

318
00:25:26,070 --> 00:25:27,480
I'll take these wontons away.

319
00:25:27,480 --> 00:25:28,180
Since you're not

320
00:25:28,180 --> 00:25:29,110
eating them, I will.

321
00:25:29,110 --> 00:25:29,840
Let's go now.

322
00:26:02,590 --> 00:26:04,030
I had the General Affairs Division

323
00:26:04,030 --> 00:26:06,290
prepare an office for you, Inspector Su.

324
00:26:07,590 --> 00:26:09,240
I prefer the previous one.

325
00:26:10,000 --> 00:26:11,240
That was for temporary use.

326
00:26:11,240 --> 00:26:12,920
Inspector Su, you arrived in a haste.

327
00:26:12,920 --> 00:26:14,980
This office is not exactly ready yet.

328
00:26:15,510 --> 00:26:17,570
Actually, it seems rather fine to me.

329
00:26:18,350 --> 00:26:21,270
All government departments
practice frugality now.

330
00:26:21,270 --> 00:26:22,880
I deeply admire
No. 76's approach of setting

331
00:26:22,880 --> 00:26:24,720
an example through its own actions.

332
00:26:24,720 --> 00:26:26,180
You may keep both offices.

333
00:26:27,590 --> 00:26:29,680
The Imperial Japanese Army Headquarters

334
00:26:29,680 --> 00:26:32,410
provides a monthly operating budget
of 300,000.

335
00:26:33,720 --> 00:26:36,880
We can certainly afford two offices.

336
00:26:38,450 --> 00:26:40,040
As long as an expenditure is justifiable

337
00:26:40,040 --> 00:26:40,970
and worthwhile,

338
00:26:41,540 --> 00:26:43,340
we'll be fully supportive of it.

339
00:26:46,550 --> 00:26:49,640
Inspector Su, your acts at the race club

340
00:26:50,110 --> 00:26:51,240
are unforgettable.

341
00:26:52,920 --> 00:26:55,920
Investigating corruption
is certainly important.

342
00:26:56,640 --> 00:26:57,840
That said, recently,

343
00:26:58,480 --> 00:27:02,340
the NBIS and the Communist Party
are intensifying their operations.

344
00:27:03,400 --> 00:27:06,200
I've already talked
with the Nanjing government.

345
00:27:07,000 --> 00:27:09,000
If you don't mind, Inspector Su,

346
00:27:09,680 --> 00:27:11,410
please stay in Shanghai for now

347
00:27:11,830 --> 00:27:15,030
to assist Director Li
in suppressing the subversive elements.

348
00:27:15,030 --> 00:27:15,680
Sure.

349
00:27:18,400 --> 00:27:19,160
Director Li,

350
00:27:20,970 --> 00:27:22,970
from this very moment on,

351
00:27:23,530 --> 00:27:26,920
should Inspector Su's safety
be compromised...

352
00:27:27,680 --> 00:27:29,590
From today on, if anything happens

353
00:27:29,590 --> 00:27:30,480
to Dr. Hoshino

354
00:27:30,830 --> 00:27:33,030
and his team, or Inspector Su,

355
00:27:33,400 --> 00:27:35,530
No. 76 will take full responsibility.

356
00:27:39,200 --> 00:27:39,830
Oh, right.

357
00:27:40,930 --> 00:27:43,680
The Hurricane Squad's actions
are getting rampant these days.

358
00:27:43,680 --> 00:27:46,070
Director Li, I wonder
if you have any plans.

359
00:27:46,070 --> 00:27:48,270
Their disorder must be checked at once.

360
00:27:50,960 --> 00:27:52,030
I've devised a plan already.

361
00:27:52,030 --> 00:27:53,960
Inspector Su, just focus on your recovery.

362
00:27:53,960 --> 00:27:56,020
No need to worry about these matters.

363
00:27:56,480 --> 00:27:58,000
Then I'll count on those elites

364
00:27:58,000 --> 00:27:59,330
under you, Director Li.

365
00:28:02,720 --> 00:28:05,720
The number of No. 76 agents
lying in wait in the streets

366
00:28:06,270 --> 00:28:09,200
is much larger than you could imagine,
Inspector Su.

367
00:28:14,000 --> 00:28:16,070
Director Li has made me a promise.

368
00:28:18,350 --> 00:28:19,810
That is, within one month,

369
00:28:19,900 --> 00:28:23,100
he will eradicate the NBIS spy network
in Shanghai.

370
00:28:27,350 --> 00:28:29,680
The Hurricane Squad is running wild.

371
00:28:29,880 --> 00:28:31,110
They have to be eliminated

372
00:28:31,110 --> 00:28:34,910
at once, or I'll be too embarrassed
to remain at my post as a director.

373
00:28:35,920 --> 00:28:37,750
Are there any clues about that ace agent

374
00:28:37,750 --> 00:28:38,480
of the NBIS,

375
00:28:39,270 --> 00:28:40,600
named the God of Wealth?

376
00:28:41,920 --> 00:28:42,720
There will be.

377
00:28:43,830 --> 00:28:45,760
There will be clues about him soon.

378
00:28:46,790 --> 00:28:47,790
An ace agent...

379
00:28:50,220 --> 00:28:53,280
Director Li, you have
your own top enforcer too, right?

380
00:28:56,830 --> 00:28:58,790
Then let's see whose ace agent

381
00:28:59,200 --> 00:29:00,260
is more competent.

382
00:29:16,350 --> 00:29:17,150
You're awake.

383
00:29:20,230 --> 00:29:21,160
Leave the hospital.

384
00:29:21,160 --> 00:29:21,830
Right now?

385
00:29:22,910 --> 00:29:26,590
The doctor said I couldn't be discharged
until after a few more days.

386
00:29:26,590 --> 00:29:27,830
You can't completely trust or ignore

387
00:29:27,830 --> 00:29:28,890
what a doctor says.

388
00:29:29,510 --> 00:29:31,910
From now on, you must
listen to your master.

389
00:29:31,960 --> 00:29:33,900
I realized long ago
that you are feigning blindness.

390
00:29:33,900 --> 00:29:35,270
You don't even put in much effort.

391
00:29:35,270 --> 00:29:36,240
Cut the crap.

392
00:30:03,590 --> 00:30:06,440
♪ I am Xi Shi ♪

393
00:30:07,090 --> 00:30:10,280
♪ What a warm, sunny day it is ♪

394
00:30:10,920 --> 00:30:18,730
♪ Let me go out to wash silk ♪

395
00:30:17,880 --> 00:30:19,410
"Xi Shi Washing Silk," huh?

396
00:30:20,350 --> 00:30:22,350
So you can sing Yue Opera, boss lady.

397
00:30:24,400 --> 00:30:25,800
I've got a whole lot more.

398
00:30:28,170 --> 00:30:28,900
Such a shame.

399
00:30:29,640 --> 00:30:32,770
No one's playing
the three-stringed instrument today.

400
00:30:34,100 --> 00:30:35,720
It's typical of that blind old man.

401
00:30:35,720 --> 00:30:38,030
He's off and on with his work.

402
00:30:39,440 --> 00:30:40,770
Still the usual, right?

403
00:30:41,030 --> 00:30:41,890
Yes, the usual.

404
00:30:42,510 --> 00:30:44,510
Prepare a special room for Mr. Zhao.

405
00:30:45,070 --> 00:30:46,930
A Yangzhou-style pedicure, too.

406
00:30:47,160 --> 00:30:48,160
Coming right up!

407
00:30:51,640 --> 00:30:52,310
Mr. Zhao,

408
00:30:52,880 --> 00:30:53,790
I'll be waiting inside.

409
00:30:53,790 --> 00:30:54,350
Sure.

410
00:30:56,720 --> 00:30:58,650
You seem a bit off today, boss lady.

411
00:31:00,920 --> 00:31:01,830
How so?

412
00:31:03,080 --> 00:31:04,880
You're more languid than usual—

413
00:31:07,400 --> 00:31:09,000
looking even more charming.

414
00:31:10,030 --> 00:31:11,030
Oh, you.

415
00:31:13,440 --> 00:31:14,720
One male guest, to a special care room.

416
00:31:14,720 --> 00:31:15,720
This way, please.

417
00:31:25,770 --> 00:31:27,970
[Fairy Bath]

418
00:31:35,060 --> 00:31:38,630
This stuff of mine works even better
than that in the hospital.

419
00:31:40,200 --> 00:31:41,440
You have to believe someone

420
00:31:41,440 --> 00:31:43,310
who survived the battlefield.

421
00:31:44,440 --> 00:31:45,720
But it hurts a lot.

422
00:31:49,160 --> 00:31:51,290
Such a slight pain amounts to nothing.

423
00:31:52,550 --> 00:31:53,950
Pull yourself together.

424
00:31:54,400 --> 00:31:57,860
You will face things that are way worse
than this in the future.

425
00:31:59,030 --> 00:31:59,960
What do you mean?

426
00:32:03,240 --> 00:32:05,370
Make sure you do your job well at No. 76.

427
00:32:05,680 --> 00:32:08,550
My job is only to take photos
for Inspector Su.

428
00:32:10,750 --> 00:32:11,920
I have a hunch

429
00:32:12,840 --> 00:32:15,080
that you will be highly valued at No. 76.

430
00:32:17,240 --> 00:32:19,040
Blind people can tell fortunes.

431
00:32:20,480 --> 00:32:21,880
You are not really blind.

432
00:32:22,110 --> 00:32:24,310
You have sharper eyes than anyone else.

433
00:32:26,770 --> 00:32:29,500
Why do you care so much about
my personal affairs?

434
00:32:32,190 --> 00:32:34,920
Are you with the Nationalists
or the Communists?

435
00:32:39,010 --> 00:32:40,740
You know the answer, don't you?

436
00:32:41,200 --> 00:32:42,510
You've never told me the truth.

437
00:32:42,510 --> 00:32:43,910
How am I supposed to know?

438
00:32:46,950 --> 00:32:47,950
One day, you will.

439
00:33:14,480 --> 00:33:15,480
Secure the area. Quick!

440
00:33:15,480 --> 00:33:16,350
Protect Mr. Hoshino!

441
00:33:16,350 --> 00:33:16,920
Hurry!

442
00:33:28,720 --> 00:33:38,680
♪ A true gentleman
never forgets a kindness ♪

443
00:33:48,830 --> 00:33:50,270
This is "The Ten Beauties."

444
00:33:50,270 --> 00:33:52,670
A true gentleman never forgets a kindness.

445
00:33:52,880 --> 00:33:54,400
I didn't see you here yesterday.

446
00:33:54,400 --> 00:33:56,130
Got a side gig at another store?

447
00:33:57,270 --> 00:33:58,000
Mr. Zhao,

448
00:33:58,240 --> 00:34:00,240
are you taking this place as a hotel?

449
00:34:00,310 --> 00:34:02,370
The Fairy Bath is cozier than hotels.

450
00:34:08,230 --> 00:34:10,480
I was just wondering
why you're a bit languid today.

451
00:34:10,480 --> 00:34:11,409
You got injured?

452
00:34:13,150 --> 00:34:15,080
A sprained ankle is no small issue.

453
00:34:15,440 --> 00:34:17,870
You'll get well in a couple of days
with Dr. Jiang's

454
00:34:17,870 --> 00:34:20,270
secret home formula for healing ointment.

455
00:34:20,620 --> 00:34:23,360
He's rather concerned
about your sprained ankle.

456
00:34:23,360 --> 00:34:26,219
What grateful workers you've employed,
boss lady.

457
00:34:27,030 --> 00:34:28,090
You're fortunate.

458
00:34:28,920 --> 00:34:31,150
Human relationships are reciprocal.

459
00:34:32,840 --> 00:34:33,699
I'm taking off.

460
00:34:34,190 --> 00:34:35,590
Sorry I can't see you out.

461
00:34:36,480 --> 00:34:37,340
Take care, sir.

462
00:34:40,030 --> 00:34:40,760
Goodbye.

463
00:34:47,630 --> 00:34:48,630
It takes some time

464
00:34:49,150 --> 00:34:50,760
for your injury to heal.

465
00:34:51,949 --> 00:34:54,679
Better be cautious from now on.

466
00:35:02,110 --> 00:35:03,440
Where is the shop owner?

467
00:35:04,400 --> 00:35:05,460
I am the shop owner.

468
00:35:08,000 --> 00:35:09,130
Section Chief Zhao.

469
00:35:09,360 --> 00:35:11,090
Be careful not to catch a chill.

470
00:35:12,880 --> 00:35:14,680
Thanks to you, my life was saved.

471
00:35:15,200 --> 00:35:17,320
I haven't had a chance to thank you yet.

472
00:35:17,320 --> 00:35:18,580
You were in great luck.

473
00:35:18,840 --> 00:35:19,570
That's true.

474
00:35:20,110 --> 00:35:21,510
We are lucky and blessed.

475
00:35:21,840 --> 00:35:23,110
Just you watch,

476
00:35:23,330 --> 00:35:24,600
we will be rich soon.

477
00:35:25,630 --> 00:35:27,800
The photos in the display window
are well taken.

478
00:35:27,800 --> 00:35:29,000
No wonder Inspector Su

479
00:35:29,000 --> 00:35:31,460
would designate you
to be her photographer.

480
00:35:31,650 --> 00:35:33,510
I also think these are well taken.

481
00:35:45,960 --> 00:35:47,020
Careful, careful.

482
00:35:48,030 --> 00:35:49,150
Here, come on.

483
00:35:51,440 --> 00:35:52,240
Get in the bed.

484
00:35:55,880 --> 00:35:57,150
Where's the booze?

485
00:35:59,920 --> 00:36:01,760
I've never seen him drink that much.

486
00:36:01,760 --> 00:36:04,490
Perhaps he's just thrilled
about your survival.

487
00:36:04,630 --> 00:36:05,630
I'll take care of him.

488
00:36:05,630 --> 00:36:07,230
You go home and get some rest.

489
00:37:23,510 --> 00:37:24,840
It's been so many years.

490
00:37:25,590 --> 00:37:27,590
If you have any questions, ask away.

491
00:37:27,850 --> 00:37:29,520
No need to sneak around.

492
00:37:31,880 --> 00:37:33,590
Everyone has their secrets.

493
00:37:49,840 --> 00:37:50,630
I won.

494
00:37:51,710 --> 00:37:53,240
Tell me your secrets first.

495
00:38:00,360 --> 00:38:02,620
Did you not apply the medicine I gave you?

496
00:38:13,190 --> 00:38:14,650
You bandaged it yourself?

497
00:38:17,920 --> 00:38:19,850
At this rate, you'll get infected.

498
00:38:21,070 --> 00:38:22,550
The NBIS only teaches how to kill,

499
00:38:22,550 --> 00:38:24,280
but never self-rescue skills.

500
00:38:24,550 --> 00:38:26,150
In their eyes, your life

501
00:38:26,280 --> 00:38:27,610
isn't worth even a dime.

502
00:38:32,630 --> 00:38:33,760
Don't be terrified!

503
00:38:34,000 --> 00:38:37,030
Sir, I entertain through singing only,
not sexual services!

504
00:38:37,030 --> 00:38:37,960
Let go of me!

505
00:38:38,510 --> 00:38:39,670
Let go of me!

506
00:38:39,920 --> 00:38:41,000
Let go of me!

507
00:38:41,590 --> 00:38:42,510
Let go of me!

508
00:38:43,880 --> 00:38:44,920
Let go of me!

509
00:39:07,630 --> 00:39:08,490
Did you do this?

510
00:39:19,880 --> 00:39:20,630
Work for me.

511
00:39:23,350 --> 00:39:24,230
Will you?

512
00:39:30,880 --> 00:39:32,010
Have you learned it?

513
00:39:34,710 --> 00:39:35,510
From now on,

514
00:39:36,360 --> 00:39:38,760
replace the dressing like this once a day.

515
00:39:44,070 --> 00:39:44,760
Thank you.

516
00:39:47,030 --> 00:39:47,960
You're welcome.

517
00:39:48,800 --> 00:39:50,460
I'm indebted to you after all.

518
00:40:18,880 --> 00:40:20,680
If I had known you were this good,

519
00:40:21,070 --> 00:40:23,130
I might not have helped you back then.

520
00:40:30,400 --> 00:40:31,590
Who exactly are you?

521
00:40:34,420 --> 00:40:37,290
Du Huangqiao, the former commander
of the 3rd Battalion, 5th Regiment,

522
00:40:37,290 --> 00:40:38,220
145th Division.

523
00:40:42,590 --> 00:40:43,480
What about now?

524
00:40:48,660 --> 00:40:49,380
Now...

525
00:40:51,070 --> 00:40:52,440
I'm here to protect you.

526
00:40:59,910 --> 00:41:00,510
Alright.

527
00:41:00,920 --> 00:41:02,240
Look here, everyone.

528
00:41:02,270 --> 00:41:03,450
Lower your heads a bit and smile.

529
00:41:03,450 --> 00:41:04,710
Little one, look here.

530
00:41:04,950 --> 00:41:05,550
Good.

531
00:41:11,110 --> 00:41:11,840
Take care.

532
00:41:12,110 --> 00:41:12,760
Thank you.

533
00:41:30,630 --> 00:41:32,070
Jinbao, I need to go out.

534
00:41:32,190 --> 00:41:33,070
For what?

535
00:41:35,400 --> 00:41:36,530
You watch the store.

536
00:41:38,280 --> 00:41:40,240
Are you the boss here or am I?

537
00:41:40,270 --> 00:41:40,980
You are!

538
00:41:53,230 --> 00:41:53,920
Musheng,

539
00:41:54,320 --> 00:41:56,520
you said you've never been to Shanghai.

540
00:41:56,630 --> 00:41:58,230
If you ever come here one day,

541
00:41:58,490 --> 00:42:00,450
I will surely show you around

542
00:42:00,790 --> 00:42:02,660
this place where I grew up.

543
00:42:03,880 --> 00:42:06,590
There are many vendors at the entrance
of the valley where I reside.

544
00:42:06,590 --> 00:42:08,830
They sell dried radish and small wontons.

545
00:42:08,830 --> 00:42:10,290
Rice soaked in broth, too.

546
00:42:18,630 --> 00:42:20,030
My favorite street

547
00:42:20,030 --> 00:42:22,290
is the Bubbling Well Road next to my home.

548
00:42:22,550 --> 00:42:23,670
I bought a custom-made

549
00:42:23,670 --> 00:42:25,760
water-green silk cheongsam here,

550
00:42:26,550 --> 00:42:27,760
which is my favorite.

551
00:42:32,000 --> 00:42:33,800
It only takes about ten minutes by tram

552
00:42:33,800 --> 00:42:35,280
from my home to the Bund.

553
00:42:35,840 --> 00:42:37,970
The sunset here is the most beautiful.

554
00:42:38,440 --> 00:42:39,510
I hope one day we can

555
00:42:39,760 --> 00:42:41,460
stand side by side on the bridge

556
00:42:41,460 --> 00:42:42,720
and watch it together.

557
00:42:44,320 --> 00:42:46,230
For cake, you must go to Kaisiling.

558
00:42:46,230 --> 00:42:47,190
They sell a kind of cake

559
00:42:47,190 --> 00:42:49,230
that was named after a French emperor,

560
00:42:49,230 --> 00:42:50,110
the Napoleon.

